      ],
      "text": "similar levels of AEs (5.0% vs 4.7%), (aRR=1.00, 95% CI: 0.59 to 1.69); and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        78.23609924316406,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "•",
