      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.428955078125,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "lower levels of amplification of drug resistance (0.6% vs 1.4%); that is, a 73% relative reduction",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        233.28009033203125,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "(aRR=0.27, 95% CI: 0.12 to 0.61).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.5286254882812,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "The GDG judged both the benefits of the 9-month regimen with linezolid and the undesirable effects",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9927978515625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4105224609375,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "to be moderate compared with the longer regimens. The certainty of evidence was judged to be very",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980332374572754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.3745727539062,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "low. Based on this, the GDG judged that the balance of health effects did not favour either the 9-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95355224609375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.6575927734375,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "regimen with linezolid or the longer regimens. The panel judged that although the balance of effects",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998449325561523,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        524.1730346679688,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "did not favour either the intervention or the comparator, several other criteria in the GRADE evidence-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968404769897461,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.2666625976562,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "to-decision tables (e.g. resources, acceptability, equity and feasibility) favoured the 9-month regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987543106079102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        206.305908203125,
        125.72310638427734,
        220.66090393066406
      ],
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        228.00994873046875,
        527.4122924804688,
        242.3649444580078
      ],
      "text": "The use of either the 9-month regimen with linezolid or the longer (18-month) regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.20989990234375,
        527.4208374023438,
        255.5648956298828
      ],
      "text": "is suggested in people with pulmonary MDR/RR-TB without fluoroquinolone resistance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        254.409912109375,
        380.7944641113281,
        268.764892578125
      ],
      "text": "(conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.36383056640625,
        221.44569396972656,
        301.0238342285156
      ],
      "text": "Summary of other evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.231689453125,
        527.4978637695312,
        322.6747131347656
      ],
      "text": "During assessment of sub-PICO 1.1, the panel noted that the cost of component medicines is likely to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984238624572754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.43170166015625,
        527.4365844726562,
        335.8747253417969
      ],
      "text": "be similar because both regimens are of the same duration and use the same component medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.6317138671875,
        527.3135375976562,
        349.0747375488281
      ],
      "text": "except for one – linezolid instead of ethionamide. The duration of linezolid use is 2 months compared",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980783462524414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.5556945800781,
        527.2840576171875,
        362.27471923828125
      ],
      "text": "(50) with 4 months for ethionamide. Based on GDF prices   the cost difference was negligible (2 months",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.97607421875,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.0317077636719,
        483.13409423828125,
        375.4747314453125
      ],
      "text": "of linezolid at 600 mg/day US$ 21, and 4 months of ethionamide at 450 mg/day US$ 32).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.735595703125,
        527.372802734375,
        397.1786193847656
      ],
      "text": "The health care costs are also likely to be similar because the two regimens are of the same duration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.93560791015625,
        498.26019287109375,
        410.3786315917969
      ],
      "text": "and have the same component medicines, except for one – linezolid instead of ethionamide.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        417.6396179199219,
        527.455322265625,
        432.0826416015625
      ],
      "text": "The panel also assumed no difference in DST needs. Both regimens are indicated for patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        430.839599609375,
        527.4147338867188,
        445.2826232910156
      ],
      "text": "MDR/RR-TB and without fluoroquinolone resistance. These patients are usually tested for rifampicin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.0395202636719,
        527.3848876953125,
        458.4825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and fluoroquinolone resistance – rapid DSTs for both of these medicines are available. It might also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.9635925292969,
        527.4191284179688,
        471.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "inh be useful to perform genotypic DST because mutations in the  A gene also confer resistance to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        470.4396057128906,
        130.77207946777344,
        484.88262939453125
      ],
      "text": "ethionamide.",
