        70.86609649658203,
        521.3167114257812,
        527.3858642578125,
        535.7597045898438
      ],
      "text": "In 2022, new evidence from programmatic implementation in South Africa was made available to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        534.5167236328125,
        527.5811767578125,
        548.959716796875
      ],
      "text": "WHO where the regimen was modified to include 2 months of linezolid (600 mg) instead of 4 months",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985440254211426,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.7166748046875,
        142.6982879638672,
        562.15966796875
      ],
      "text": "of ethionamide.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
