        70.86609649658203,
        569.4205932617188,
        527.389404296875,
        583.8635864257812
      ],
      "text": "Based on an assessment of the certainty of the evidence, carried out using predefined criteria and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
